	Slider "How far they travel", "rss_ambient_reach", 128, 4096, 32, 0
	Option "Shape", "rss_ambient_shape", "RSS_Shape"
	StaticText "The four SWEEP shapes are one front crossing the", "gold"
	StaticText "whole map. They ignore the origin and reach below", "gold"
	StaticText "and take both from the map's own size, because a", "gold"
	StaticText "sweep that starts in the middle or stops halfway", "gold"
	StaticText "is not a sweep. Bars are abs() -- two planes", "gray"
	StaticText "moving APART from the origin, which is a split.", "gray"
	StaticText ""
	Option "Centred on", "rss_ambient_org", "RSS_Origin"
